# Global gitignore patterns
#
# Philosophy: This file should only contain patterns for files created by YOUR
# personal environment (operating system, editor, tools), NOT files created by
# projects (build artifacts, dependencies, language-specific outputs).
#
# For project-specific ignores, use the project's .gitignore file and refer to
# GitHub's language-specific templates: https://github.com/github/gitignore

# =============================================================================
# Operating System Files
# =============================================================================
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# =============================================================================
# Editor and IDE Temporary Files
# =============================================================================
# Vim swap files
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Note: IDE configuration directories (.vscode/, .idea/, etc.) are intentionally
# NOT included here. Let each project decide whether to share IDE settings.

# =============================================================================
# Temporary and Backup Files
# =============================================================================
*.tmp
*.temp
*.log
*.cache
*.bak
*.backup

# =============================================================================
# Personal Development Tools
# =============================================================================
# direnv
.direnv/
.envrc

# wt worktree orchestration: generated per-worktree runtime identity
.env.worktree

# ctags
tags
TAGS

# =============================================================================
# Binary and Compiled Files (Platform-specific)
# =============================================================================
# Executables and libraries that should never be in source control
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# =============================================================================
# Archive and Package Files
# =============================================================================
# Common archive formats (included for convenience)
# Note: Some projects may intentionally commit archives - override per-project
*.7z
*.dmg
*.gz
*.iso
*.rar
*.tar
*.zip

# =============================================================================
# Claude Code - Session Data
# =============================================================================
# Prevent accidental commit of Claude Code session data
.claude/debug/
.claude/sessions/
.claude/cache/
.claude/*.log

# =============================================================================
# Codex CLI - Session Data
# =============================================================================
# Prevent accidental commit of local Codex runtime data
.codex/auth.json
.codex/history.jsonl
.codex/log/
.codex/models_cache.json
.codex/sessions/
.codex/tmp/
.codex/version.json
